# Production build defaults.
#
# These provide a same-origin default for production builds. A static-site
# deployment without an API proxy must override VITE_API_URL at build time with
# its absolute backend URL.
#
# `/api` is correct for the container image, where nginx proxies it to the
# backend (see `deploy/nginx.conf.template`). The shared API client falls back
# to VITE_API_URL when VITE_API_BASE_URL is not set.
VITE_API_URL=/api
